WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.043 --> 00:00:15.125
have to get downtown," thought Roxy.

2
00:00:15.145 --> 00:00:18.647
"I need to figure out who robbed that armored truck!"

3
00:00:19.748 --> 00:00:21.109
Roxy looked at the snack bar.

4
00:00:21.129 --> 00:00:25.252
"I also need to buy my friends' snacks.

5
00:00:26.212 --> 00:00:27.473
I'll do that when I get back."

6
00:00:28.574 --> 00:00:30.956
Just then she saw a man buy the last pretzel.

7
00:00:32.388 --> 00:00:33.288
"Oh no!"

8
00:00:33.728 --> 00:00:34.349
said Roxy.

9
00:00:34.369 --> 00:00:36.569
"Terrell wanted a pretzel.

10
00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:38.870
Oh well.

11
00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.771
I have more important things to worry about right now!"

12
00:00:47.792 --> 00:00:49.833
Soon Roxy was in downtown Metro City.

13
00:00:51.113 --> 00:00:52.774
An armored truck was on the sidewalk.

14
00:00:53.774 --> 00:00:54.954
It was lying on its side.

15
00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:57.735
Detective Smith was talking to two guards.

16
00:00:58.855 --> 00:01:00.456
He was writing in his small notebook.

17
00:01:02.668 --> 00:01:03.348
"Hi, Detective!"

18
00:01:03.588 --> 00:01:04.829
called Roxy as she landed.

19
00:01:04.849 --> 00:01:08.069
"Are you giving these guys a parking ticket?"

20
00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:11.790
"Very funny," said the detective.

21
00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:14.491
"I'm not writing a parking ticket.

22
00:01:15.311 --> 00:01:16.232
I'm taking notes."

23
00:01:17.472 --> 00:01:18.652
He looked at the two guards.

24
00:01:18.672 --> 00:01:20.693
"What happened next?"

25
00:01:21.913 --> 00:01:23.174
"Well," said the driver.

26
00:01:23.194 --> 00:01:25.534
"We were on our way to the bank."

27
00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:28.155
"Yep," said the other guard.

28
00:01:28.175 --> 00:01:32.989
"Suddenly something grabbed the truck," said the driver.

29
00:01:33.009 --> 00:01:35.010
"Then the truck crashed.

30
00:01:36.551 --> 00:01:38.973
By the time we got out, all the money was gone!"

31
00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:44.697
Roxy looked closely at the truck.

32
00:01:45.697 --> 00:01:47.379
"That's weird," she said.

33
00:01:48.499 --> 00:01:50.981
She pointed to a dent that went around the whole truck.

34
00:01:51.001 --> 00:01:55.825
"It looks like something was wrapped around the truck, like a lasso."

35
00:01:56.785 --> 00:01:58.046
The driver's eyes lit up.

36
00:01:58.066 --> 00:02:00.528
"Maybe it was a lasso!

37
00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:04.681
After we crashed, we heard someone yell 'Yee-ha!'"

38
00:02:05.782 --> 00:02:06.922
He looked at the other guard.

39
00:02:06.942 --> 00:02:10.764
"Remember?" "Yep," said the other guard.

40
00:02:11.704 --> 00:02:13.925
"Yee-ha?" said Detective Smith.

41
00:02:13.945 --> 00:02:16.226
"That's what cowboys say."

42
00:02:16.246 --> 00:02:19.107
"It sure is," said the driver.

43
00:02:19.127 --> 00:02:21.048
"We heard a horse too."

44
00:02:21.068 --> 00:02:24.209
"Yep," said the other guard.

45
00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:27.150
Roxy folded her arms.

46
00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:31.332
"I just figured out who robbed this armored truck."

47
00:02:32.416 --> 00:02:34.017
Detective Smith looked surprised.

48
00:02:34.037 --> 00:02:35.297
"You did?"

49
00:02:35.317 --> 00:02:37.779
"Yes," said Roxy.

50
00:02:37.799 --> 00:02:39.739
"It was Stinky Bart!"

51
00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:43.521
"Stinky Bart, the outlaw cowboy?"

52
00:02:43.721 --> 00:02:44.502
said the detective.

53
00:02:44.522 --> 00:02:46.242
"That's right!"

54
00:02:46.542 --> 00:02:47.183
said Roxy.

55
00:02:47.203 --> 00:02:50.764
"He's the only outlaw cowboy in Metro City."

56
00:02:51.645 --> 00:02:53.226
Detective Smith rubbed his chin.

57
00:02:53.246 --> 00:02:55.727
"You're right, Rocket Girl.

58
00:02:56.707 --> 00:02:58.468
Stinky Bart must be the thief."

59
00:02:59.556 --> 00:03:03.219
"And I'm sure he'll try to rob more armored trucks," said Roxy.

60
00:03:04.199 --> 00:03:05.420
"We need to stop him."

61
00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:09.043
"First we need to find him," said the detective.

62
00:03:10.123 --> 00:03:12.265
Roxy nodded and stared at the busy street.

63
00:03:14.587 --> 00:03:15.747
Lots of cars went by.

64
00:03:16.688 --> 00:03:17.989
Big city buses went by.

65
00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:20.951
And then an armored truck went by.

66
00:03:20.971 --> 00:03:24.493
"I'll follow that armored truck," said Roxy.

67
00:03:25.434 --> 00:03:27.996
"Sooner or later Stinky Bart will try to rob it.

68
00:03:28.811 --> 00:03:30.066
And I'll be ready!"
